# Lure of the Wildcat (Bastok) (bastok 84): Alib-Mufalib in Port Bastok and twenty NPCs in the four Bastok zones. The
# guard (ENABLE_TOAU 1, the default): 357 (the Blue Sentinel Badge, begun); Alib-Mufalib's 358 at Prog 0, 359 with some
# bits, 360 with all twenty (the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the Blue Invitation Card, fame 0); each NPC's
# event once (its bit unset) and nil after (Kaede in Port Bastok is talked to twice). Completed: Alib-Mufalib's own
# script (361 before ToAU's President Salaheem). #toau_off is the guard's other side.
# The char is a WAR of level 20 at fame 0, so the other quests at these NPCs stay silent: Ayame and Kaede (Kaede's 240
# from level 30), Faded Promises (a NIN at Ayame and Kagetora), A Question of Faith (Ayame, fame level 4), Cid's
# Secret / The Usual / LB04 (Hilda), Teak Me to the Stars / DRK AF1 (Raibaht), The Siren's Tear (Echo Hawk), WAR AF2 /
# AF3 (Deidogg), DNC AF3 (Harmodios), Chasing Dreams (Patient Wheel), Stamp Hunt (Arawn's 225 is an offer to anyone: a
# Progress that alternates with 429; the setup completes Stamp Hunt), Breaking Stones (Horatius, C#), Vengeful Wrath
# (Goraow, C#), Silence of the Rams (Paujean, C#). Check each first talk's answer with show and fix the comments.
lists PortBastok/Alib-Mufalib/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/357 PortBastok/onEventFinish/360 PortBastok/Kaede/onTrigger PortBastok/Patient_Wheel/onTrigger PortBastok/Paujean/onTrigger PortBastok/Hilda/onTrigger PortBastok/Tilian/onTrigger Metalworks/Raibaht/onTrigger Metalworks/Invincible_Shield/onTrigger Metalworks/Manilam/onTrigger Metalworks/Kaela/onTrigger Metalworks/Ayame/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Harmodios/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Arawn/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Horatius/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Ken/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Pavel/onTrigger BastokMines/Griselda/onTrigger BastokMines/Goraow/onTrigger BastokMines/Echo_Hawk/onTrigger BastokMines/Deidogg/onTrigger BastokMines/Vaghron/onTrigger
char zone=PortBastok pos=116.1,7.4,-31.8 job=WAR lvl=20
quest Bastok.StampHunt completed
item BoneChip
login
trade Alib-Mufalib BoneChip x1 # available: no trade handler; his script's trade (300 gil only): nothing
trigger Kaede                  # available: no handler, Kaede's default 26
finish
trigger Alib-Mufalib           # ENABLE_TOAU 1: 357
finish                         # the Blue Sentinel Badge, begun
trigger Alib-Mufalib           # Prog 0: 358
finish
trigger Kaede                  # bit 0 unset: 352
finish                         # bit 0
trigger Kaede                  # bit 0 set: nil, 26
finish
trigger Alib-Mufalib           # some bits: the quest's Event 359, but his last answer was the Event 358, so the lookup
                               # alternates to his script (UseFallback): 361
finish
trigger Alib-Mufalib           # some bits: 359
finish
trigger Patient_Wheel          # 354
finish                         # bit 1
trigger Paujean                # 355
finish                         # bit 2
trigger Hilda                  # 356
finish                         # bit 3
trigger Tilian                 # 353
finish                         # bit 4
warp -27,-10,-1 Metalworks
trigger Raibaht                # 933
finish                         # bit 5
trigger Invincible_Shield      # 932
finish                         # bit 6
trigger Manilam                # 931
finish                         # bit 7
trigger Kaela                  # 934
finish                         # bit 8
trigger Ayame                  # 935
finish                         # bit 9
warp -79.9,-4.8,-135.1 BastokMarkets
trigger Harmodios              # 430
finish                         # bit 10
trigger Arawn                  # 429
finish                         # bit 11
trigger Horatius               # 428
finish                         # bit 12
trigger Ken                    # 432
finish                         # bit 13
trigger Pavel                  # 431
finish                         # bit 14
warp -25.7,0,52.4 BastokMines
trigger Griselda               # 507
finish                         # bit 15
trigger Goraow                 # 506
finish                         # bit 16
trigger Echo_Hawk              # 505
finish                         # bit 17
trigger Deidogg                # 504
finish                         # bit 18
trigger Vaghron                # 503
finish                         # bit 19: Prog 0xFFFFF
warp 116.1,7.4,-31.8 PortBastok
trigger Alib-Mufalib           # all twenty: 360
finish                         # the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the Blue Invitation Card
trigger Alib-Mufalib           # completed: no section, his own script's 361
finish
